hters are actively engaged in combat or in post-fight activities**\n\n- From **Frame 2215 to 2223**: Active grappling on the ground.\n- **Frame 2224–2225**: Referee intervenes, appears to stop the fight.\n- **Frame 2226–2227**: Fighters separated, referee declares winner.\n- **Frame 2228 onward**: Fighters are standing, walking to corners, post-fight behavior.\n- **Conclusion**: Combat ends around Frame 2225; post-fight activities begin immediately after.\n\n---\n\n### 6. **Round transitions or time announcements**\n\n- No round transitions are visible — early UFC events like UFC V had no rounds; fights continued until submission, knockout, or time limit.\n- The timer reaching 31:06 likely indicates the **end of the time limit** (not a round end), and the fight was stopped with Shamrock declared winner (likely via decision or referee stoppage due to time).\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Final Determination:\n\n- The **fight duration is 31 minutes and 6 seconds**, as shown by the timer counting up from start to finish.\n- The answer choice **“2”** (which you mentioned likely corresponds to **36 minutes**) **does NOT match** the visual evidence.\n- The actual duration shown in the frames is **31:06**, not 36 minutes.\n\n---\n\n## 🚫 Verification of Answer “2” (36 minutes):\n\n- The timer never reaches 36 minutes in any frame.\n- The fight ends at 31:06.\n- Therefore, **“2” is incorrect** based on the visual evidence provided.\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Correct Answer:\n\n**The match lasted 31 minutes and 6 seconds.**\n\n*(If forced to choose from answer choices where “2” = 36 minutes, then “2” is wrong. The correct choice would be the one corresponding to 31 minutes — likely “1” or another option not listed here.)*'}, {'batch_start': 30, 'batch_end': 60, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/cXDT44zT8JY/frames/frame_2245.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/cXDT44zT8JY/frames/frame_2505.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/cXDT44zT8JY/frames/frame_2506.jpg', '/